SUMMARY:Fork in the Road Reception + Screening 🎟️
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261014T221500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261015T001500
DTSTAMP:20260914T205141Z
UID:6a970a18c4b7247c54e12b02@woodstockfilmfestival.org
DESCRIPTION:The evening at White Feather Farm begins with a special “Fea
 st of Plant Friends” reception\, created by Kyra Kristof and herForest K
 itchenpartner\, Hannah Gant. Enjoy an animist relational feast featuring a
  broad range of plant friends from the Hudson Valley\, paired with cocktai
 ls\, before settling in for a screening ofFork in the Road.\n\nFollowing t
 he screening\, stay for a Q&A moderated by Kathleen Finlay\, President & C
 EO\, Glynwood Center for Regional Food and Farming\, and Founder\, Pleiade
 s Network\; with Tianna Kennedy\, Executive Director of theCatskills Agrar
 ian Alliance\; and filmmakers Vivian Sorenson and Lisa Holmes\, featuring 
 a conversation about building just and community-centered food systems for
  people and the planet.\n\n🎟️ Tickets Available\n\n🔗 https://woods
 tockfilmfestival.org/2026-all-events?eventId=6a970a18c4b7247c54e12b02
LOCATION:Broken Wing Barn at White Feather Farm
URL:https://woodstockfilmfestival.org/2026-all-events?eventId=6a970a18c4b7
 247c54e12b02
END:VEVENT
